# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# Only the WebFinger line below is needed for ActivityPub. It exists so the
# handle can stay @veganhomecooks@veganhomecooks.online while the Worker itself
# lives on ap.veganhomecooks.online: a fediverse server looking up that handle
# asks the *bare* domain for /.well-known/webfinger, which Pages serves, so the
# request has to be forwarded to the Worker. Query strings are preserved.
#
# If this repo already has a static/_redirects file, append this line to it
# rather than replacing the file.

/.well-known/webfinger  https://ap.veganhomecooks.online/.well-known/webfinger  302